    ],
    "text": "L.D.-O 41/2024",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      79.2,
      103.5,
      286.11,
      116.97
    ],
    "text": "An Act to amend the Penal Code (Chapter 19)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      126.5,
      309.71,
      152.97
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      163.34,
      309.71,
      189.97
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Penal Code (Amendment) Act, No. of 2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      202.34,
      309.71,
      254.97
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 82 of the Penal Code (Chapter 19) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby amended by the insertion immediately before the illustration to that section, of the following:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      92.2,
      267.5,
      309.71,
      306.97
    ],
    "text": "\u201cFifthly \u2013 That this exception shall not extend to the imposing of corporal punishment in respect of children.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      319.34,
      309.71,
      358.97
    ],
    "text": "3. Section 308a of the principal enactment is hereby amended in subsection (1) thereof, by the substitution for the word \u201cwilfully\u201d, of the word \u201cintentionally\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      371.34,
      309.76,
      410.97
    ],
    "text": "4. The following new section is hereby inserted immediately after section 308a of the principal enactment and shall have effect as section 308b of that enactment: -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      116.2,
      423.34,
      309.72,
      462.97
    ],
    "text": "308b. (1) Whoever, having the custody, charge, or care of any person under eighteen years of age, commits -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      144.2,
      475.5,
      309.71,
      553.97
    ],
    "text": "(a) as a measure of punishment or correctional method, an act for which physical force is used, with knowledge that such act is likely to cause some degree of pain or discomfort however light; or",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      51.44,
      202.29,
      56.44,
      215.76
    ],
    "text": "5",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      48.94,
      280.77,
      58.94,
      294.24
    ],
    "text": "10",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      49.36,
      373.2,
      59.36,
      384.67
    ],
    "text": "15",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      49.36,
