    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      80.0,
      79.97,
      310.63,
      237.44
    ],
    "text": "exceeding two years, or with fine which may extend to one hundred thousand rupees, or with both and may also be ordered to pay compensation of an amount determined by court after considering the victim impact statement filed by the National Authority for the Protection of Victims of Crime and Witnesses established under the Assistance to and Protection of Victims of Crime and Witnesses Act, No. 10 of 2023, to the person in respect of whom the offence was committed for the injuries caused:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      124.0,
      235.97,
      310.61,
      285.44
    ],
    "text": "Provided that, where the offender is a person under eighteen years of age, the court may impose a sentence of imprisonment for a term less than six months.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      124.0,
      295.97,
      310.62,
      333.44
    ],
    "text": "(4) For the purposes of this section \u201ccustody under a state authority\u201d means any custody within the meaning of any written law.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      136.49,
      346.05,
      251.61,
      356.83
    ],
    "text": "Illustrations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      141.0,
      370.05,
      310.11,
      424.83
    ],
    "text": "(a) A, being the child of B, refuses to follow B\u2019s orders to study for an examination. B hits A with a belt as a punishment. A sustains physical injuries due to this act. B has committed the offence of corporal punishment.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      141.0,
      436.05,
      310.11,
